Backports of four upstream parser fixes onto vLLM 0.31.0 for the Qwen3 tool-call path (qwen3_coder / qwen3_xml):
  #61253 (engine: per-argument value extender; needed by #62027; import hunk adapted to 0.31)
  #62027 (stream Qwen3 tool argument values incrementally: no re-parse of the whole argument per chunk)
  #61217 (forward skipped tool spans verbatim in the reasoning pass: literal </think> in an argument survives)
  #59882 (keep an unclosed last <parameter=...> when </function> closes the call; hand-ported, open upstream)
Tests: tests/parser (0.31 suite + the PRs' tests): 4882 passed, 2 skipped.

